        <description><![CDATA[<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #263445; background-color: #f4f7fb; padding: 24px; border-radius: 10px;">
<div style="background: linear-gradient(120deg, #123b65, #1676a8); color: white; padding: 35px 30px; border-radius: 10px; margin-bottom: 25px;">
<div style="font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #c5e8ff; margin-bottom: 12px;">EMPLOYEE SERVICES</div>
<h1 style="font-size: 30px; margin: 0 0 15px 0; color: white;">Remote Work Setup</h1>
<p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7; max-width: 750px; margin: 0;">Everything you need to work remotely, all in one place. Request your laptop, network access, collaboration tools, workspace equipment, and other essential services through a single, streamlined request.</p>
<div style="margin-top: 22px;"><span style="background: #ffffff; color: #14527b; padding: 9px 17px; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px;"> ONE-STOP REMOTE WORK SOLUTION </span></div>
</div>

<div style="background: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 9px; margin-bottom: 22px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
<h2 style="color: #174d78; font-size: 21px; margin-top: 0;">Welcome to Your Remote Workspace</h2>
<p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 0;">Whether you are transitioning to remote work or setting up a home office for the first time, this Order Guide helps you request all the equipment and services required for a productive and secure remote working experience. Select the services you need, provide the required details, and submit your request through one convenient process.</p>
</div>

<div style="margin-bottom: 22px;">
<h2 style="font-size: 21px; color: #174d78; margin-bottom: 8px;">What Can You Request?</h2>
<p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 18px;">Choose from the following equipment and services based on your remote working requirements.</p>
<table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: separate; border-spacing: 10px;"><tbody><tr><td style="width: 50%; background: white; padding: 19px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="font-size: 27px;">&#x1f4bb;</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: #174d78; margin: 10px 0;">Laptop Request</h3>
<p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Request a company-approved laptop with the required hardware specifications and software configuration for your role.</p>
</td><td style="width: 50%; background: white; padding: 19px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="font-size: 27px;">&#x1f510;</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: #174d78; margin: 10px 0;">VPN Access</h3>
<p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Request secure VPN connectivity to access internal company applications and resources while working remotely.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="background: white; padding: 19px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="font-size: 27px;">&#x1f4ac;</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: #174d78; margin: 10px 0;">Collaboration Tools</h3>
<p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Request access to collaboration platforms such as Microsoft Teams and Zoom for meetings, communication, and teamwork.</p>
</td><td style="background: white; padding: 19px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="font-size: 27px;">&#x1f5a5;️</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: #174d78; margin: 10px 0;">Monitor &amp; Docking Station</h3>
<p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Improve your productivity with additional display monitors and docking stations for a convenient workstation.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td style="background: white; padding: 19px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="font-size: 27px;">&#x1fa91;</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: #174d78; margin: 10px 0;">Ergonomic Accessories</h3>
<p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Request ergonomic accessories such as keyboards, mice, laptop stands, and other equipment for a comfortable workspace.</p>
</td><td style="background: white; padding: 19px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; vertical-align: top;">
<div style="font-size: 27px;">&#x1f310;</div>
<h3 style="font-size: 16px; color: #174d78; margin: 10px 0;">Home Internet Reimbursement</h3>
<p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">Submit a home internet reimbursement request in accordance with your organization&#39;s applicable reimbursement policy.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
</div>

<div style="background: #e8f3fb; padding: 24px; border-radius: 9px; margin-bottom: 22px;">
<h2 style="font-size: 21px; color: #174d78; margin-top: 0;">Why Use This Order Guide?</h2>
<div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong style="color: #174d78;">✓ One-Stop Request Experience</strong>
<p style="font-size: 13px; margin: 5px 0 0 22px; line-height: 1.6;">Request multiple remote work services through one centralized experience instead of submitting individual requests.</p>
</div>
<div style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong style="color: #174d78;">✓ Faster Employee Enablement</strong>
<p style="font-size: 13px; margin: 5px 0 0 22px; line-height: 1.6;">Simplify the process of equipping employees with the tools and access needed to work remotely.</p>
</div>
<div><strong style="color: #174d78;">✓ Simplified Procurement Process</strong>
<p style="font-size: 13px; margin: 5px 0 0 22px; line-height: 1.6;">Consolidate equipment and service requests to streamline approvals, fulfillment, and tracking.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background: white; padding: 24px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 9px; margin-bottom: 22px;">
<h2 style="font-size: 21px; color: #174d78; margin-top: 0;">How Does It Work?</h2>
<div style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 2;">
<p><strong style="color: #1676a8;">01. Select Services</strong><br />Choose the equipment and services you require for your remote workspace.</p>
<p><strong style="color: #1676a8;">02. Provide Information</strong><br />Enter the necessary details for each selected item, including specifications and business justification where applicable.</p>
<p><strong style="color: #1676a8;">03. Submit Your Request</strong><br />Review your selections and submit the consolidated order guide request.</p>
<p><strong style="color: #1676a8;">04. Approval &amp; Fulfillment</strong><br />Your request will be routed to the relevant teams for approval, procurement, and fulfillment.</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong style="color: #1676a8;">05. Start Working Remotely</strong><br />Receive the requested equipment and access to get your remote workspace ready.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div style="background: #fff8e8; border-left: 4px solid #e5a12b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 22px;">
<h3 style="color: #875b13; margin-top: 0; font-size: 17px;">Important Information</h3>
<ul style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.9; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;"><li>Select only the services and equipment you actually require.</li><li>Provide accurate employee and delivery information.</li><li>Ensure that your requests comply with company IT and procurement policies.</li><li>Some items may require manager approval or additional authorization.</li><li>Reimbursements are subject to applicable company policies and eligibility.</li></ul>
</div>

<div style="background: #123b65; color: white; padding: 22px; text-align: center; border-radius: 9px;">
<h2 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: white;">Your Workspace. Your Way.</h2>
<p style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6; color: #d8eaf7; margin: 0;">Get everything you need to stay connected, productive, and comfortable while working remotely.</p>
<p style="font-size: 11px; color: #b8d4e8; margin: 17px 0 0 0;">IT SERVICE MANAGEMENT | EMPLOYEE SELF-SERVICE</p>
</div>
</div>]]></description>
